# The trigger is "when Kokusho dies" (CR 700.4): Bot2's Swords to Plowshares exiles it instead, so nothing drains - Bot2 stays at 20 - and
# Bot1 only gains the 5 life Swords itself gives its controller. The death scenario (Vindicate) is the existing one, the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Kokusho, the Evening Star
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kokusho, the Evening Star.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Kokusho, the Evening Star)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Kokusho, the Evening Star
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Life = 25
